sequenceDiagram
    participant C as MCP Client
    participant S as MCP Server
    participant V as Schema Validator
    participant L as RPM Limiter
    participant R as Retry Policy
    participant P as Agnes Provider
    participant A as Agnes API

    C->>S: call generate_images(items[])
    S->>V: validate request and defaults
    V-->>S: normalized items
    loop each item (FIFO, max 10)
      S->>L: acquire token by size (default RPM)
      L-->>S: permit
      S->>R: execute generation with retry policy
      R->>P: generate(item)
      P->>A: POST /v1/images/generations
      A-->>P: image URL
      P-->>R: normalized provider result
      R-->>S: URL or typed error
      S->>S: download HTTPS image
      S->>S: validate MIME, magic bytes, size
      S->>S: write output/ after validation
    end
    S-->>C: MCP JSON envelope with per-item results
